        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Moe Greene, Moe Dalitz, Hyman Martin\n- Works: The Godfather\n- Topics: Organized crime, casinos\n\nFacts:\n- Moe Dalitz was Morris Barney Dalitz, an American gangster, businessman, casino owner, and philanthropist who lived from December 25, 1899 to August 31, 1989.\n- Hyman Martin was Hyman \"Pittsburgh Hymie\" Martin, a Pittsburgh mobster who lived from April 6, 1903 to July 1987.\n- Moe Greene is a fictional character who appeared in Mario Puzo's 1969 novel The Godfather and in the 1972 film adaptation of the same name.\n- Hyman Martin was a close associate of Moe Dalitz and Louis Rothkopf.",
